      }
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "type": "details",
      "attributes": {
        "key": "documentation",
        "value": "Transitions have \"trigger\" reference that is of type Event. The occurrence of an event called the \"trigger\" may involve state change during the control process if all additional conditions on the transition are verified.\nIn the context of FSMModel, occurrences of events that are \"trigger\" are MoCInterfaces (Send / Receive / Ack) and MoCEvents."
      }
    },
    {
